# Data CSVs are LF in the repo and LF on checkout. The scrapers write LF
# (lineterminator="\n"), and 125 files committed before that fix were
# back-filled by normalize_line_endings.py (see docs/crlf-normalized.md).
# Without this, a contributor whose git reintroduces CRLF -- or any tool that
# rewrites a file with platform line endings -- could silently undo that, and
# nothing in CI checks for it.
*.csv text eol=lf
